Snowboy KWS standalone adapter

This distribution contains the Snowboy C++ interface, ARMv7 static library,
and common.res resource from KITT.AI Snowboy 1.3.0. These files are distributed
under the Apache License 2.0 in third_party/snowboy/LICENSE.

This distribution contains an ARMv7 OpenBLAS 0.3.21 static library. OpenBLAS is
distributed under the 3-clause BSD license in third_party/openblas/LICENSE.

No personal or universal hotword model is included. Hotword model licensing is
separate from the Snowboy engine and must be checked by the user.
